    engine().setItemDataDelay(seconds)
end

--- Where the next `C_Container.SortBags` puts the bags' items (the
--- server's sort): `{ [bag] = { [slot] = { id, count, shownFirst, after } } }`
--- (a merged stack shown first with `shownFirst`, its `count` `after`
--- seconds later).
